    <string name="nutrition_calculator">Goal calculator</string>
    <string name="nutrition_calc_info">1. Resting energy (Mifflin–St Jeor): 10 × weight (kg) + 6.25 × height (cm) − 5 × age, plus 5 for men or minus 161 for women.\n2. Maintenance = resting energy × activity factor: sedentary 1.2, light 1.375, moderate 1.55, active 1.725, very active 1.9.\n3. Goal = maintenance − 20 % to lose, the same to maintain, + 10 % to gain, rounded to 10 kcal.\n4. Protein by body weight (2.0 g/kg losing, 1.6 maintaining, 1.8 gaining), fat 25 % of the kcal, carbohydrates the rest.\nIt is an estimate: adjust it by watching your weight trend over a few weeks.</string>
